OL,3,AInside the FBI hack: Agents fearful and
OL,4,Aangry after 'dangerous' data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrent and former FBI agents have
OL,7,Fspoken to BBC News of their shock, fear
OL,8,Fand anger following a hack that appears
OL,9,Fto have exposed the private and
OL,10,Fpersonal information of the agency's
OL,11,Fentire workforce.
OL,13,F"This is really bad for our undercover
OL,14,Fagents," says one former FBI agent, who
OL,15,Ffears for the safety of his colleagues.
OL,17,FThe former cyber investigator is in a
OL,18,Fgroup chat with current agents who are
OL,19,Fworried their personal information
OL,20,Fcould soon be freely available online
OL,21,Fto criminals and hostile nation-state
OL,22,Fhackers.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,116,105,200,160,0,100
