OL,3,AInside the FBI hack: Agents fearful and
OL,4,Aangry after 'dangerous' data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe says staff fear they could be
OL,7,Ftargeted, or that criminals could use
OL,8,Fthe data to create highly convincing
OL,9,Fphishing attempts, scams or demands for
OL,10,Fbribes.
